    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwanamume yeyote aliyehasiwa au aliyekatwa uume wake haruhusiwi kujiunga na kusanyiko la watu wa Mwenyezi-Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na mwana haramu yeyote, wala mzawa wake hata kizazi cha kumi, haruhusiwi kuingia katika kusanyiko la watu wa Mwenyezi-Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwamoni au Mmoabu yeyote, wazawa wao wote hata kizazi cha kumi, hawaruhusiwi kuingia katika kusanyiko la watu wa Mwenyezi-Mungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa sababu walikataa kuwapatia chakula na maji mlipokuwa njiani kutoka Misri, na kwa kuwa walimwajiri Balaamu mwana wa Beori kutoka Pethori kule Mesopotamia, awalaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, hakumsikiliza Balaamu; badala yake laana hiyo iligeuka kuwa baraka, kwa kuwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, aliwapenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, kamwe msiwasaidie hao wapate amani na fanaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Msiwachukie Waedomu; hao ni ndugu zenu. Na msiwachukie Wamisri, kwani mlikaa katika nchi yao kama wageni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazawa wao, kuanzia kizazi cha tatu, wataruhusiwa kuingia katika kusanyiko la watu wa Mwenyezi-Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mkienda vitani, mkapiga kambi, kila mmoja ajihadhari na kitu chochote kiovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama miongoni mwenu kuna mtu yeyote ambaye ni najisi kwa sababu ya kutokwa mbegu usiku, huyo atatoka nje ya kambi; hatakaa karibu na kambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini ikifika jioni ataoga, na jua likitua anaweza kurudi kambini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lazima muwe na mahali nje ya kambi ambapo mnaweza kwenda haja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kati ya vifaa vyenu mtakuwa na jembe, na hilo mtatumia kuchimba shimo na kufukia kinyesi chenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kambi yenu lazima iwe takatifu kwa kuwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, anatembea kambini mwenu ili awaokoe na kuwatia adui zenu mikononi mwenu. Kwa hiyo msimwache aone kitu chochote kisichofaa miongoni mwenu, la sivyo atawaacheni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mtumwa akikimbilia kwako usimrudishe kwa bwana wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ataishi pamoja nawe mahali atakapochagua katika mojawapo ya makao yako, mahali panapompendeza. Usimdhulumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwisraeli yeyote, mwanamume au mwanamke, haruhusiwi kamwe kuwa kahaba wa kidini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fedha yoyote iliyopatikana kwa vitendo vya ukahaba huo, isipelekwe hekaluni kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, kulipia nadhiri, maana mwanamume au mwanamke aliye kahaba wa kidini ni chukizo kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Usimkopeshe ndugu yako Mwisraeli kitu kwa riba; usimtoze riba juu ya mkopo wa fedha, chakula, au chochote ambacho watu hukopesha kwa riba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unaweza kutoza riba unapomkopesha mgeni, lakini ndugu yako Mwisraeli usimtoze riba, naye Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, atakubariki katika shughuli zako zote utakazofanya katika nchi ambayo unakwenda kuimiliki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unapoweka nadhiri kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, usichelewe kuitekeleza, maana Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako ataidai kwako, nawe utakuwa na kosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini ukiacha kuweka nadhiri hutakuwa na dhambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe mwangalifu kutimiza nadhiri uliyotamka kwa mdomo wako, maana ulimwahidi Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, kwa hiari yako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ukipitia katika shamba la mzabibu la jirani yako unaweza kula zabibu kadiri uwezavyo, lakini usichume na kuchukua zabibu zozote kikapuni mwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukipitia katika shamba la jirani yako lenye nafaka unaweza kukwanyua masuke kwa mkono na kula, lakini usichukue mundu kukata mazao yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
